@startuml
left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
package "Orquestación" as Driver { component GNAT1drv }
package "Frontend" as FE { component Frontend }
package "Léxico y parser" as Parser { component Scn
component Scans
component Par }
package "Modelo compartido" as Model { component Atree
component Sinfo
component Einfo
component Types
component Namet }
package "Semántica" as Semantics { component Sem
component "Sem_Ch* / Sem_*" }
package "Expansión" as Expansion { component Expander
component "Exp_Ch* / Exp_*" }
package "Adaptador backend" as Backend { component Back_End
component "jbackend.adb" }
package "Traducción Ada" as Translation { component Jx_Drive
component "Jx_Ch* / Jx_Decl" }
package "Modelo de código" as Code { component JVM
component "JVM.API / Code / Map / Info / Pool" }
package "Emisión MSIL" as Emit { component "JVM.MSIL_Emit" }
Driver ..> FE
Driver ..> Backend
FE ..> Parser
FE ..> Semantics
FE ..> Model
Parser ..> Model
Semantics ..> Model
Semantics ..> Expansion
Expansion ..> Semantics
Backend ..> Translation
Translation ..> Code
Translation ..> Model
Code ..> Emit
Emit ..> Code
note bottom of Backend
Makefile selecciona jbackend.adb como back_end.adb.
end note
note bottom of Code
Nombre JVM heredado; JVM.adb llama MSIL_Emit.
end note
@enduml
